    "https://careers.werecruit.io/en/escp-business-school/offers/audiovisual-technician---fixed-term-contract-069e7e": {
      "title": "Audiovisual Technician",
      "description": "Audiovisual Technician - Fixed-Term Contract F/H - Temporary contract 2 months in Paris | Découvrez nos offres Menu Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP Plus See our jobs EN EN FR Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP EN EN FR See our jobs Audiovisual Technician - Fixed-Term Contract F/H Apply to this job Audiovisual Technician - Fixed-Term Contract F/H I apply Published on               \n                13/10/2026 Contract type: Temporary contract\n- 2 months Work time: Full time Location Paris The company ESCP Business School is the world-renowned business school, founded in 1819, that trains the responsible leaders of tomorrow. Located in the heart of Paris, it offers innovative and multicultural teaching, supported by a network of six European campuses. Recognized for the excellence of its management programs, it fosters engagement, international awareness, and personalized support for talent throughout their studies. Post description Purpose of the Role As part of a fixed-term contract, reporting, reporting to the Head of Audiovisual Services, you will play a key role in enhancing and ensuring the smooth operation of equipped spaces – classrooms, lecture halls, studios, hybrid spaces and event venues – while guaranteeing the technical and artistic quality of educational and institutional productions and events. Key Responsibilities Your responsibilities are organised around 4 main areas: Operations & User Support: You prepare, install and operate audiovisual equipment for classes, conferences, filming and events (in-person and hybrid). You provide technical assistance and respond quickly in the event of an incident. Maintenance & Equipment Management: You oversee first-level preventive and corrective maintenance. You manage equipment inventories and materials, and report any needs for replacement or repair. Content Production & Broadcasting: You carry out recordings (cameras, microphones, lighting), produce recordings and participate in editing/postproduction (Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Adobe CC). You also manage live broadcasting and make replays and archives available. Projects & Innovation: You contribute to projects aimed at developing audiovisual infrastructure and participate in testing, installation and configuration phases. You take part in innovative experiments (360° recording, VR, hybrid systems). Profile required We are looking for an audiovisual technician who can combine technical knowledge with a strong sense of service. What we expect from you: Proficiency in audiovisual equipment (cameras, control consoles, audio/video systems, video projectors). Proven skills in video recording, sound recording, streaming and postproduction. Proficiency in IT and networking applied to audiovisual systems. Experience with editing tools (Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Adobe CC). Ability to work independently, attention to detail and responsiveness. Excellent interpersonal skills when working with diverse audiences (teaching staff, students, internal teams, service providers). Réf: 069e7eca-a79a-49b1-906b-893aada47a88 Apply Audiovisual Technician - Fixed-Term Contract F/H Temporary contract - 2 months Full time Paris Title * Mrs. Mr. Mx Last name * First name * E-mail * Phone number * Availability * Select your availability immediate 2 weeks 1 month 2 months 3 months > 3 months Salary expectations (Gross/year) * Select a salary expectation Inferior than 15 000€ 15 000€ - 20 000€ 20 000€ - 25 000€ 25 000€ - 30 000€ 30 000€ - 35 000€ 35 000€ - 40 000€ 40 000€ - 45 000€ 45 000€ - 50 000€ 50 000€ - 55 000€ 55 000€ - 60 000€ 60 000€ - 65 000€ 65 000€ - 70 000€ 70 000€ - 75 000€ 75 000€ - 80 000€ 80 000€ - 85 000€ Superior than 85 000€ Photo Choose file Format: JPG \nWeight: max 2 MO. Resume * Choose file Format: .PDF,  .DOCX, .DOC. Weight: max 2 MO. Quel est votre niveau d'anglais ? * Select an answ